    "Looks through your photos for faces and for cats and dogs, then offers them as collections. This is the one thing ShotDex does that opens each photo in full, so it is slower than indexing and better left to a charger.\n\nIt all happens on this iPhone, and it counts faces without recognising anyone — iOS gives apps no way to tell one person from another.": {},
